17:Tc39,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Is it really free?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Your blog, hosting and domain connection are free up to 10,000 visits a month. No credit card needed."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Will Google index my blog?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, from day one, including on your free outrankblog.com address. Connect your own domain or subfolder, also free, so every post builds your own site's authority. Blogs that break our content policy stay hidden from search engines until they move to their own domain."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I use my own domain?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Connect a subdomain like blog.yourbrand.com, a subfolder like yourbrand.com/blog, or a domain used only for the blog. We give you the exact steps for your setup."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How is it different from Blogger, WordPress.com or Medium?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Your posts live on your own domain or subfolder, so every article builds your site's authority instead of a platform's. There are no ads and no plugins to maintain, and when you are ready, Outrank can research keywords and publish 30 SEO articles a month for you."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Will there be ads on my blog?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No. Outrank never adds ads or sponsored links to your blog. Free blogs only show a small â€œPublished with Outrankâ€ badge in the footer."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do I get a sitemap and an RSS feed?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Every blog has an XML sitemap, an RSS feed, robots.txt and llms.txt, kept up to date for you, and new posts are submitted to search engines through IndexNow."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I collect email subscribers?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Add newsletter forms in the footer, at the end of posts or inside any post. Export your subscribers as a CSV file, or send them to your email tool with webhooks."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can my blog be in another language?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Write in any language. Buttons, dates and labels are translated into English, French, Spanish, German, Italian, Portuguese or Dutch."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What happens if I go over the visit limit?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Your blog stays online and every reader is served. We let you know when you get close. If you stay over the limit two months in a row, publishing new posts pauses until you upgrade."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can Outrank write the articles for me?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Every free blog includes 3 AI-written posts. Upgrade to have Outrank research keywords and publish 30 SEO articles a month to your blog, on autopilot."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What happens to my blog if I stop paying for Outrank?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Nothing goes offline. Your blog moves back to the free plan and keeps all its posts."}}]}18:{"src":"/_next/static/media/twitter.9ad14e5c.svg","height":17,"width":16,"blurWidth":0,"blurHeight":0}
